::  modules/tally/glow/gate-tally-wal.glow -- Blazepod WAL Sequence!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-wal-append-seq
  |=  [prev-seq=@ud next-seq=@ud ring-cap=@ud]          ::  seq+1 & <=32 cap
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified seq
  ~|  'blazepod-tally-vn-wal-seq-or-ring-cap-breach'    ::  ten-year stone
  ?>  &(eql(next-seq +(prev-seq)) lte(next-seq ring-cap))
  next-seq
--
